PASS refused r2 tree (watchdog child of the owner) is admitted -> admitted
PASS orphan duplicate Claude with the same --resume (PPID 1) is refused -> another process of the author session is live
PASS space-separated --resume token outside the owner tree is refused -> another process of the author session is live
PASS wrong owner birth is refused -> owner birth does not match
PASS owner PID that is not an ancestor is refused -> owner PID is not an ancestor of this runner
PASS owner without the exact token (different id) is refused -> owner lacks the exact --resume token
PASS unrelated commands mentioning the id are admitted -> admitted
PASS unrelated launcher.py / smi.py are admitted -> admitted
PASS a live foreign v6 harness is refused -> another v4/v5/v6/v6.1 control process is live
PASS a live control under the owner but outside the runner chain is refused -> another v4/v5/v6/v6.1 control process is live
PASS a mock process in another gpu_worker_v6_controls namespace is refused -> another v4/v5/v6/v6.1 control process is live
